<title>USA: Omaha hogs mostly off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs mostly off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in barrows and gilts was slow, prices mostly off $0.50. Top $56.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   230-260 lbs    56.00-56.50</p>
<p>Sows: 12 percent.  Not established.</p>
</text>
